        <div id="grammar-section">
            <div class="tense-block">
                <div class="tense-title">1. Present Simple (المضارع البسيط)</div>
                <p>يستخدم للحقائق والعادات المتكررة.</p>
                <div class="rule-box">(I, We, You, They) + Verb (inf)</div>
                <div class="rule-box">(He, She, It) + Verb + (s / es)</div>
                <div class="example-box">Example: Mona usually washes the dishes.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tense-block">
                <div class="tense-title">2. Present Continuous (المضارع المستمر)</div>
                <p>يصف فعلاً يحدث الآن.</p>
                <div class="rule-box">Am / Is / Are + Verb + ing</div>
                <div class="example-box">Example: Look! The bus is coming.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tense-block">
                <div class="tense-title">3. Present Perfect (المضارع التام)</div>
                <p>كلمات دالة: just, for, yet, never, since.</p>
                <div class="rule-box">Have / Has + Past Participle (P.P)</div>
                <div class="example-box">Example: Ali has not finished his work yet.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tense-block">
                <div class="tense-title">4. Past Simple (الماضي البسيط)</div>
                <p>كلمات دالة: yesterday, ago, last.</p>
                <div class="rule-box">Subject + Verb (Past Form)</div>
                <div class="example-box">Example: He visited my uncle three days ago.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tense-block">
                <div class="tense-title">5. IF Clauses (قواعد لو الشرطية)</div>
                <div class="rule-box">IF 1: Present Simple -> Will + inf</div>
                <div class="rule-box">IF 2: Past Simple -> Would + inf</div>
                <div class="rule-box">IF 3: Past Perfect -> Would have + P.P</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-controls">
